From 7268ec02532d9769b811615971f1d1a5ba0a2486 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nassos Yiannopoulos <nassosyian@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:04:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 53/54] hw/display/pvg: indirect draws/dispatches, multisample
 render passes, 3D mipmaps

- DrawPrimitivesIndirect (0x10), DrawIndexedPrimitivesIndirect (0x11),
  DispatchThreadgroupsIndirect (0xc9), DispatchThreadsIndirect (0xe6): the
  argument structs are read from guest memory (earlier segments are written
  back before a segment is recorded) and executed as direct commands;
  base vertex / base instance honoured.
- MSAA: a pass whose attachments carry a resolve texture and a multisample
  source renders into an N-sample host image (kept between passes for Load),
  N-sample depth and pipelines, and resolves (average / sample 0 for integer
  formats) into the resolve texture that is written back. Property msaa.
- generateMipmaps handles 3D textures (2x2x2 box filter).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
